{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01E4XjMSv8PtSz7datg14Pxq","type":"tool_result","content":"283:- `input.codeLabel(code)`: a code as a person reads it: 'W' (or the keyboard's own letter there), 'Space', '↑', 'Left click', and a gamepad button by its symbol on the controller in use ('A', '✕', 'B'...; glyphs picks the family)\n292:- `input.label(a, device = this.lastDevice)`: the key or button to show in a prompt for action a, on the device the player used last (or the one named: 'keyboard' | 'mouse' | 'gamepad' | 'touch'), with their bindings: input.label('jump') -> 'Space', 'A' or '✕'\n297:- `input.padStyle()`: the controller family whose symbols label() shows: glyphs, or with glyphs 'auto' the one its name says\n300:- `input.press(code)`: press a key or button code ('KeyJ', 'Mouse0', 'Pad0', 'Act:attack') as if the person did: scripted input, tests, bots\n326:- `input.glyphs = 'auto'`: the gamepad's button symbols for label(): 'auto' (from the controller's name) | 'xbox' | 'playstation' | 'nintendo' | 'generic' (positions)\n327:- `input.held`: the key and button codes down right now ('KeyD', 'Mouse0', 'Pad0', 'Act:jump')\n329:- `input.lastDevice = 'keyboard'`: 'keyboard' | 'mouse' | 'gamepad' | 'touch', the last one used (show the right button prompts)\n330:- `input.map`: each action's codes ({ jump: ['Space', 'Pad0', 'Act:jump'] }); every action also answers to 'Act:<name>' (DOM buttons with data-act, tap, hold)\n350:- `input.touchEnabled = true` †: false turns the touch stick off\n360:- `E.font.title(g, s, x, y, o = {})`: Big logo text for title screens: scaled glyphs with a vertical color gradient, an outline and an extruded 3D edge. title(g, 'CASTLE OF NIGHT', x, y, { scale: 3, colors: ['#fff6c8', '#ffd36a', '#e07a2a'], outline: '#1a0c10', depth: 3, depthColor: '#6a2a1a', align: 'center' })\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181310__xac1bf5/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0fcdb66e-7b81-4152-a7ad-a6f1924439c0","uuid":"b8451c07-1602-44ba-9a79-4d67e71f54cc","timestamp":"2026-11-03T01:16:27.304Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"283:- `input.codeLabel(code)`: a code as a person reads it: 'W' (or the keyboard's own letter there), 'Space', '↑', 'Left click', and a gamepad button by its symbol on the controller in use ('A', '✕', 'B'...; glyphs picks the family)\n292:- `input.label(a, device = this.lastDevice)`: the key or button to show in a prompt for action a, on the device the player used last (or the one named: 'keyboard' | 'mouse' | 'gamepad' | 'touch'), with their bindings: input.label('jump') -> 'Space', 'A' or '✕'\n297:- `input.padStyle()`: the controller family whose symbols label() shows: glyphs, or with glyphs 'auto' the one its name says\n300:- `input.press(code)`: press a key or button code ('KeyJ', 'Mouse0', 'Pad0', 'Act:attack') as if the person did: scripted input, tests, bots\n326:- `input.glyphs = 'auto'`: the gamepad's button symbols for label(): 'auto' (from the controller's name) | 'xbox' | 'playstation' | 'nintendo' | 'generic' (positions)\n327:- `input.held`: the key and button codes down right now ('KeyD', 'Mouse0', 'Pad0', 'Act:jump')\n329:- `input.lastDevice = 'keyboard'`: 'keyboard' | 'mouse' | 'gamepad' | 'touch', the last one used (show the right button prompts)\n330:- `input.map`: each action's codes ({ jump: ['Space', 'Pad0', 'Act:jump'] }); every action also answers to 'Act:<name>' (DOM buttons with data-act, tap, hold)\n350:- `input.touchEnabled = true` †: false turns the touch stick off\n360:- `E.font.title(g, s, x, y, o = {})`: Big logo text for title screens: scaled glyphs with a vertical color gradient, an outline and an extruded 3D edge. title(g, 'CASTLE OF NIGHT', x, y, { scale: 3, colors: ['#fff6c8', '#ffd36a', '#e07a2a'], outline: '#1a0c10', depth: 3, depthColor: '#6a2a1a', align: 'center' })","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opu