{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WbKyVYoqzm7GAC8LpZmTQV","type":"tool_result","content":"20:- Collision, standing, sight (`map.sight`, `map.ray`), reach (`E.targets`, `E.inArc` with `dz`) and navigation (`E.FlowField`) all follow these rules. `E.dist` is 3D; `E.overlap` is flat.\n41:if (!map.sight(guard, hero)) throw new Error('eyes on a roof see down into the street');\n485:- `game.mouseGround()`: mouse position on the ground (world units), or null\n669:- `rig.drawPortrait(g, x, y, size = 40, o = {})` †: a close-up bust for dialog boxes and menus, drawn live from the rig (blinks, hair and hats included): rig.drawPortrait(g, x, y, 40, { zoom: 3, turn: .6, bg: '#1a2050', frame: true }) // inside r.overlay(g => ...) zoom: pixels per world unit (3 = face fills the frame), turn: 0 = facing you, .6 = three-quarter. The bust stays upright while the rig kneels or lies down (upright: false shows the real pose); cape: false hides the cape; tint: '#808080' greys it out (a KO'd party member).\n766:- `map.sight(a, b, o = {})`: can a's eyes (z + eye) see b's chest (z + chest)? E.HEIGHTS gives both unless o ({ eye, target }) or the bodies' own eye and chest say otherwise. A guard sees over a planter lower than its eyes, and down from a roof\n7148:    let mx = 0, my = 0, sprint = false, jumpPressed = false, crouchPressed = false, raw = [0, 0];\n7153:      crouchPressed = has('crouch') && ctl.pressed('crouch'); if (crouchPressed && !this.wall) this.crouch = !this.crouch;\n7154:    } else if (ctl) { const m = ctl.move || [0, 0]; mx = m[0]; my = m[1]; raw = [m[0], m[1], true]; sprint = !!ctl.sprint; jumpPressed = !!ctl.jumpPressed; crouchPressed = !!ctl.crouch; if (ctl.crouch !== undefined && !this.wall) this.crouch = !!ctl.crouch; }\n7162:    if (this.wall) { this._climbStep(dt, map, raw, v, jumpPressed, crouchPressed); return this; }\n7238:  _climbStep(dt, map, raw, view, jumpPressed, crouchPressed) {\n7243:    if (crouchPressed || !this._tire('climb', dt * (up || side ? 1 : .25))) { this.wall = null; this.crouch = false; this.vz = 0; return; }   // let go (or out of stamina): it falls\n2449:  /** the players: [game.input (player 1), ...the ones who joined (game.allowJoin, game.addPlayer: section 10j)]; each an\n3657: *    numpad on the right), touch for player 1. game.allowJoin({ max, onJoin }) lets them in: Start on a free pad, or 2 (the\n3670: *  in order, and the preset's gamepad codes (Input.halfKeys(Input.SHMUP, 'right') -> fire on . and Numpad 1, bomb on /) */\n3678:const _pPreset = (game, q) => q.half ? Input.halfKeys(game.input._full || game.input.preset, q.half) : (game.input._full || game.input.preset);\n3686: *  (input, number) as each does. allowJoin(false) closes it (the names split and join are String's and Array's) */\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181310__xac1bf5/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0fcdb66e-7b81-4152-a7ad-a6f1924439c0","uuid":"f76e7a14-3ce2-4544-a9a3-cb261b0ef8e4","timestamp":"2026-11-03T01:19:47.693Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"20:- Collision, standing, sight (`map.sight`, `map.ray`), reach (`E.targets`, `E.inArc` with `dz`) and navigation (`E.FlowField`) all follow these rules. `E.dist` is 3D; `E.overlap` is flat.\n41:if (!map.sight(guard, hero)) throw new Error('eyes on a roof see down into the street');\n485:- `game.mouseGround()`: mouse position on the ground (world units), or null\n669:- `rig.drawPortrait(g, x, y, size = 40, o = {})` †: a close-up bust for dialog boxes and menus, drawn live from the rig (blinks, hair and hats included): rig.drawPortrait(g, x, y, 40, { zoom: 3, turn: .6, bg: '#1a2050', frame: true }) // inside r.overlay(g => ...) zoom: pixels per world unit (3 = face fills the frame), turn: 0 = facing you, .6 = three-quarter. The bust stays upright while the rig kneels or lies down (upright: false shows the real pose); cape: false hides the cape; tint: '#8080