\\\" content=\\\\\\\"1\\\\\\\">\\\\n<meta name=\\\\\\\"hub:session-players\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"1-4\\\\\\\">\\\\n<meta name=\\\\\\\"hub:session-mode\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"ghost\\\\\\\">\\\\n<meta name=\\\\\\\"hub:session-goal\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"Cook and sell the most product before time runs out\\\\\\\">\\\\n<meta name=\\\\\\\"hub:session-howto\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"Move: left stick or WASD. Use: Cross or E. Cook by following the prompts\\\\\\\">\\\\n<meta name=\\\\\\\"hub:session-minutes\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"3\\\\\\\">\\\\n<meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\\\\\\\">\\\\n<meta name=\\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"Breaking Bond: a chemistry teacher, a diagnosis, a change. A spiritual successor to Breaking Bad.\\\\\\\">\\\\n<title>Breaking Bond · Episode One: Pilot Light</title>\\\\n<style>html, body { margin: 0; height: 100%; background: #000; overflow: hidden } #screen { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; image-rendering: pixelated; touch-action: none }</style>\\\\n</head>\\\\n<body>\\\\n<div id=\\\\\\\"e3-boot\\\\\\\" role=\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:40;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;gap:6px;padding:20px;background:#0b0806;color:#c8b898;font:12px/1.5 ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace\\\\\\\"><style>@keyframes e3-run{from{transform:translateX(-100%)}to{transform:translateX(340%)}}@keyframes e3-late{to{opacity:1}}</style><b style=\\\\\\\"color:#f4f0e0;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.08em\\\\\\\">BREAKING BOND</b><span>Starting · my-3D2dge</span><span style=\\\\\\\"display:block;height:4px;max-width:440px;overflow:hidden;background:#ffffff14\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\"display:block;width:30%;height:100%;background:#59c8f0;animation:e3-run 1.2s ease-in-out infinite\\\\\\\"></span></span><span style=\\\\\\\"opacity:0;animation:e3-late .3s 12s forwards\\\\\\\">Still starting. If this stays, th