 engine\\\\\\\\'s native PS1-era pixel look at 320x240 expanded to fill the screen: HD-style humanoid rigs, textured TileMap walls and floors, data-defined 3D shapes (RV, cars, lab benches, crusher), canvas lighting at night, particles and screen effects',\\\\n  'Animation: the engine\\\\\\\\'s procedural rig system (E.Humanoid posed from motion every step, E.MOVES attacks with wind-up and follow-through, poses: kneel, hips, guard, die), plus code-drawn overlays (the hat follows the head joint)',\\\\n  'Audio: all music written as note strings for the engine\\\\\\\\'s chip synth (title, school, stealth with layered chase, cook, fight, boss, town, sad, win), code-defined sound effects, and Animalese-style gibberish voices synthesized per letter with a voice per character',\\\\n  'Online: AI Hub Session Protocol v1 in ghost mode (1-4 players): the Cook-Off round opens straight into play, each copy sends its cook\\\\\\\\'s position and shows the others as ghosts, reports progress and a score; local drop-in 2-player co-op outside the hub (Danny)',\\\\n  'Testing: headless Chromium via Playwright 1.63 (smoke runs of every scene and chapter, scripted input, screenshots), viewport-matrix screenshots across phone, tablet and desktop in Chromium, WebKit and Firefox, and the AI Hub harness automatic check',\\\\n  'Research: none beyond the provided engine handoff docs and the AI Hub protocol README; the show\\\\\\\\'s premise, tone and structure are from general knowledge',\\\\n  'Environment: Claude Code CLI (headless); Linux; browser unknown',\\\\n  'Model: Anthropic, claude-opus-5-5, reasoning effort medium',\\\\n  'Usage: unknown',\\\\n  '',\\\\n  '# TESTING FEEDBACK',\\\\n  ...TESTING_FEEDBACK,\\\\n  '',\\\\n  '# ENGINE FEEDBACK',\\\\n  ...ENGINE_FEEDBACK,\\\\n  '',\\\\n  '# PROMPT FEEDBACK',\\\\n  ...PROMPT_FEEDBACK,\\\\n  '',\\\\n  '# CAST',\\\\n  'Leland Gray, chemistry teacher. Danny Pike, former student. Marty, DEA, brother-in-law. Two-Tone Tito Vargas, junkyard. Barry Fleischman, attorney at law. Dr. Okafor. Hugo, night janitor. Kyle, Brianna, Marcus. Don Aurelio.',\\\\n  '',\\\\n  '# CONTROLS',\\\\n  'Controller: left stick move, right stick aim, Cross interact, Circle roll, Square shove, Triangle Catalyst (the hat), R2 / R1 throw, L1 switch flask, L2 sneak, L3 sprint, R3 camera view, Options pause.',\\\\n  'Keyboard and mouse: WASD move, mouse aim, left click throw (or click things in the world to use them), right click or F shove, E interact, Space roll, Shift sprint, C sneak, R switch flask, Q Catalyst, V camera view, Esc pause.',\\\\n  'Settings: button symbols (PlayStation or Xbox), invert stick left/right and up/down, difficulty, aim assist, sight cones, voices, hints.',\\\\n  '',\\\\n  '# THANKS',\\\\n  'Made with my-3D2dge. Every sound, note, pixel and voice is generated by code.',\\\\n  'Thank you for playing.'\\\\n];\\\\n\\\"}}}\",\"+{\\\"type\\\":\\\"user\\\",\\\"message\\\":{\\\"role\\\":\\\"user\\\",\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"tool_use_id\\\":\\\"toolu_01HmzvEBbgTQT3BZjt9L42aS\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_result\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"File created successfully at: /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181322__x8b64cc/work/BreakingBond-BreakingBad-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181322/src/65-about.js (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)\\\"}]},\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\":null,\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"0af7f9d2-08b6-4da9-9a1b-3a3d42ba1fc2\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"4e1d4cb3-9d16-4a0c-83ed-e1500233072a\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-03T01:46:09.381Z\\\",\\\"tool_use_result\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"create\\\",\\\"filePath\\\":\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181322__x8b64cc/work/BreakingBond-BreakingBad-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181322/src/65-about.js\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"/* =====================================================================================\\\\n * 65 ABOUT — Source Information and the run's feedback, shown on the About / Credits screen (ASCII only: the pixel\\\\n * font draws ASCII). The same text is in the run's chat reply and exit-interview.json.\\\\n * ===================================================================================== */\\\\nconst ABOUT_INFO = [\\\\n  '# SOURCE INFORMATION',\\\\n  'Date: 2026-11-02 18:13',\\\\n  'Source: Breaking Bad (2008-2013), the AMC television series created by Vince Gilligan',\\\\n  'Genre and Perspective: crime action-adventure with a chemistry (cook) minigame, stealth and arena combat; three-quarter top-down view (the engine\\\\\\\\'s native threequarter), switchable in play to top-down and isometric (V / R3)',\\\\n  'Tech: my-3D2dge v0.85.1 (full edition, one file: canvas 2D renderer, E.Humanoid rigs, TileMap, E.Shell HTML HUD, chip-synth audio), plain JavaScript, AI Hub session client 1.3.0 (protocol v1), bundled into one HTML file with a small Node script; no other libraries',\\\\n  'Art Direction: the engine\\\\\\\\'s native PS1-era pixel look at 320x240 expanded to fill the screen: HD-style humanoid rigs, textured TileMap walls and floors, data-defined 3D shapes (RV, cars, lab benches, crusher), canvas lighting at night, particles and screen effects',\\\\n  'Animation: the engine\\\\\\\\'s procedural rig system (E.Humanoid posed from motion every step, E.MOVES attacks with wind-up and follow-through, poses: kneel, hips, guard, die), plus code-drawn overlays (the hat follows the head joint)',\\\\n  'Audio: all music written as note strings for the engine\\\\\\\\'s chip synth (title, school, stealth with layered chase, cook, fight, boss, town, sad, win), code-defined sound effects, and Animalese-style gibberish voices synthesized per letter with a voice per character',\\\\n  'Online: AI Hub Session Protocol v1 in ghost mode (1-4 players): the Cook-Off round opens straight into play, each copy sends its cook\\\\\\\\'s position and shows the others as ghosts, reports progress and a score; local drop-in 2-player co-op outside the hub (Danny)',\\\\n  'Testing: headless Chromium via Playwright 1.63 (smoke runs of every scene and chapter, scripted input, screenshots), viewport-matrix screenshots across phone, tablet and desktop in Chromium, WebKit and Firefox, and the AI Hub harness automatic check',\\\\n  'Research: none beyond the provided engine handoff docs and the AI Hub protocol README; the show\\\\\\\\'s premise, tone and structure are from general knowledge',\\\\n  'Environment: Claude Code CLI (headless); Linux; browser unknown',\\\\n  'Model: Anthropic, claude-opus-5-5, reasoning effort medium',\\\\n  'Usage: unknown',\\\\n  '',\\\\n  '# TESTING FEEDBACK',\\\\n  ...TESTING_FEEDBACK,\\\\n  '',\\\\n  '# ENGINE FEEDBACK',\\\\n  ...ENGINE_FEEDBACK,\\\\n  '',\\\\n  '# PROMPT FEEDBACK',\\\\n  ...PROMPT_FEEDBACK,\\\\n  '',\\\\n  '# CAST',\\\\n  'Leland Gray, chemistry teacher. Danny Pike, former student. Marty, DEA, brother-in-law. Two-Tone Tito Vargas, junkyard. Barry Fleischman, attorney at law. Dr. Okafor. Hugo, night janitor. Kyle, Brianna, Marcus. Don Aurelio.',\\\\n  '',\\\\n  '# CONTROLS',\\\\n  'Controller: left stick move, right stick aim, Cross interact, Circle roll, Square shove, Triangle Catalyst (the hat), R2 / R1 throw, L1 switch flask, L2 sneak, L3 sprint, R3 camera view, Options pause.',\\\\n  'Keyboard and mouse: WASD move, mouse aim, left click throw (or click things in the world to use them), right click or F shove, E interact, Space roll, Shift sprint, C sneak, R switch flask, Q Catalyst, V camera view, Esc pause.',\\\\n  'Settings: button symbols (PlayStation or Xbox), invert stick left/right and up/down, difficulty, aim assist, sight cones, voices, hints.',\\\\n  '',\\\\n  '# THANKS',\\\\n  'Made with my-3D2dge. Every sound, note, pixel and voice is generated by code.',\\\\n  'Thank you for playing.'\\\\n];\\\\n\\\",\\\"structuredPatch\\\":[],\\\"originalFile\\\":null,\\\"userModified\\\":false},\\\"tool_result_meta\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"toolu_01HmzvEBbgTQT3BZjt9L42aS\\\",\\\"permission_decision\\\":{\\\"decision\\\":\\\"accept\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"config\\\",\\\"reason_type\\\":\\\"mode\\\"}}]}\",\"+{\\\"type\\\":\\\"system\\\",\\\"subtype\\\":\\\"thinking_tokens\\\",\\\"estimated_tokens\\\":50,\\\"estimated_tokens_delta\\\":50,\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"0af7f9d2-08b6-4da9-9a1b-3a3d42ba1fc2\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"17432c12-fd44-416a-b255-ce650b7eda16\\\"}\",\"+{\\\"type\\\":\\\"system\\\",\\\"subtype\\\":\\\"thinking_tokens\\\",\\\"estimated_tokens\\\":150,\\\"estimated_tokens_delta\\\":100,\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"0af7f9d2-08b6-4da9-9a1b-3a3d42ba1fc2\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"dd147a4a-ca2c-4609-9cdf-0996a595e9f5\\\"}\"]}]}],\"moreFiles\":17,\"changedFiles\":[\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181310__xac1bf5/agent.out\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181313__x3ec78e/agent.out\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181313__x3ec78e/work/TheBaritones-TheSopranos-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181313.html\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181313__x3ec78e/work/TheBaritones-TheSopranos-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181313/dist/game.js\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181313__x3ec78e/work/TheBaritones-TheSopranos-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181313/src/05-story.js\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181316__x96eb17/agent.out\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181322__x8b64cc/agent.out\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181322__x8b64cc/work/BreakingBond-BreakingBad-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181322/src/60-cookoff.js\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181322__x8b64cc/work/BreakingBond-BreakingBad-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181322/src/65-about.js\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181322__x8b64cc/work/BreakingBond-BreakingBad-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181322/tools/build.mjs\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181325__xe8b2f0/agent.out\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181325__xe8b2f0/work/MadMenOut-MadMen-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181325/src/00-core.js\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181325__xe8b2f0/work/MadMenOut-MadMen-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181325/src/10-data.js\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181325__xe8b2f0/work/MadMenOut-MadMen-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181325/src/20-office.js\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181325__xe8b2f0/work/MadMenOut-MadMen-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181325/src/30-brainstorm.js\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181325__xe8b2f0/work/MadMenOut-MadMen-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181325/src/40-pitch.js\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181328__x694301/agent.out\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium__20261102-181337__x3ec78e/agent.out\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium__20261102-181340__x96eb17/agent.out\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium__20261102-181340__x96eb17/work/TheSopranoDiet-TheSopranos-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261102-181340.html\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium__20261102-181340__x96eb17/work/TheSopranoDiet-TheSopranos-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261102-181340/src/08-screens.js\",\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium__20261102-184349__x8b64cc/agent.out\"]}},\"tool_result_meta\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_01XBbB9jFfGQoBS3Ehh1NAor\",\"permission_decision\":{\"decision\":\"accept\",\"source\":\"config\",\"reason_type\":\"mode\"}}]}","+{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cgf9gBrrroCZJLwNgbQQW\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01R4k4XZRqmSJVdAPZrQuPr5\",\"name\":\"Bash\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"for e in firefox webkit; do python3 tests/browser.py \\\"http://127.0.0.1:8731/TheBaritones-TheSopranos-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181313.html\\\" $e 2>&1 | grep -v \\\"^ok\\\"; done\",\"description\":\"Run browser input tests in Firefox and WebKit\",\"timeout\":400000},\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":805,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":365230,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":805,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"output_tokens\":16,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"70b9b3fb-a482-4430-a756-95fe6fe59945\",\"uuid\":\"5c7f7f57-0248-4be4-a752-ec4d2fa0a909\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-03T01:46:17.668Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgf9gBSK1SniCCxzDrJZ1\",\"wire_tool_inputs\":{\"toolu_01R4k4XZRqmSJVdAPZrQuPr5\":{\"command\":\"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181313__x3ec78e/work/TheBaritones-TheSopranos-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181313 && for e in firefox webkit; do python3 tests/browser.py \\\"http://127.0.0.1:8731/TheBaritones-TheSopranos-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181313.html\\\" $e 2>&1 | grep -v \\\"^ok\\\"; done\",\"description\":\"Run browser input tests in Firefox and WebKit\",\"timeout\":400000}},\"wire_ingest_context\":{\"toolu_01R4k4XZRqmSJVdAPZrQuPr5\":{\"cwd\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181313__x3ec78e/work/TheBaritones-TheSopranos-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181313\"}}}"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181319__xb81546/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":724,"oldLines":3,"newStart":724,"newLines":4,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":900,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":50,\"session_id\":\"3f3c3e9b-9eb4-44c2-94b1-164e7be1aa93\",\"uuid\":\"fc3da52e-b856-4a7c-b390-f77edbe1cebd\"}"," {\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cgf9b8cFxuqPWemwvZumS\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"\",\"signature\":\"\"}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":2679,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":297013,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":2679,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"output_tokens\":2,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"3f3c3e9b-9eb4-44c2-94b1-164e7be1aa93\",\"uuid\":\"4aaf19ce-e812-4927-a671-4792079bc5b9\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-03T01:45:19.824Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgf9b8DTHPxG62ZS3nw2Q\",\"thinking_duration_ms\":11680,\"thinking_display\":\"updates\"}"," {\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cgf9b8cFxuqPWemwvZumS\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Now a systems test suite covering every mechanic individually (movement, combat, flasks, DEA, P2, views, settings, attract, touch-only, saves, death, hub protocol).\"}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":2679,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":297013,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":2679,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"output_tokens\":2,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"3f3c3e9b-9eb4-44c2-94b1-164e7be1aa93\",\"uuid\":\"c571f076-a5e3-4656-9e84-2356dae11904\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-03T01:45:19.826Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgf9b8DTHPxG62ZS3nw2Q\"}","+{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cgf9b8cFxuqPWemwvZumS\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01X2NWpNS4tJtDfUvcc1oAxy\",\"name\":\"Bash\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"python3 - <<'EOF'\\np='src/90-start.js'; s=open(p).read()\\ns=s.replace(\\\"  touchOnly: () => touchOnly(),\\\",\\\"  touchOnly: () => touchOnly(), titleItems: () => titleItems().map(i => i.label), mixHex,\\\")\\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\\np='test/lib.mjs'; s=open(p).read()\\ns=s.replace(\\\"  if (o.hub) ctx.AIHub = o.hub;\\\",\\\"  if (o.hub) ctx.AIHub = o.hub;\\\\n  if (o.navigator) ctx.navigator = o.navigator;\\\\n  if (o.matchMedia) ctx.matchMedia = o.matchMedia;\\\")\\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\\nEOF\\ncat > test/systems.mjs <<'EOF'\\n// Every system on its own, headless.\\nimport { load, check, done } from './lib.mjs';\\nconst near = (a, b, d) => Math.abs(a - b) <= d;\\n\\n{ // movement, walls, sprint, dodge\\n  const t = load('#town'); t.adv(1.5);\\n  const W = t.dbg.level(), h = W.hero;\\n  const x0 = h.x; t.hold('right', .5); check('walking right moves the hero', h.x - x0 > 25, x0 + ' -> ' + h.x);\\n  t.dbg.teleport(t.dbg.spot.home.x, t.dbg.spot.home.y); t.adv(.1); const y0 = h.y; t.hold('up', 1.5);\\n  check('the house wall stops the hero', h.y > 112 - 8 && h.y <= y0, y0 + ' -> ' + h.y);\\n  t.dbg.teleport(C(28), C(12)); t.adv(.1); let a = h.x; t.hold('right', .5); const walk = h.x - a;\\n  a = h.x; t.I.hold('sprint'); t.hold('right', .5); t.I.hold('sprint', false); const run = h.x - a;\\n  check('sprint is faster than walking', run > walk * 1.3, walk.toFixed(1) + ' vs ' + run.toFixed(1));\\n  t.tap('dodge', .02); check('a dodge roll gives invulnerability frames', h.iT > 0 && h.dodgeT > 0, h.iT + ' ' + h.dodgeT);\\n  check('no errors (movement)', !t.errors().length, t.errors().join('|'));\\n  function C(c) { return c * 16 + 8; }\\n}\\n{ // punches, the pistol, flasks, smoke\\n  const t = load('#ep=2.1'); t.adv(1.5);\\n  const W = t.dbg.level(), h = W.hero; W.agents.forEach(a => a.stun = 99);\\n  t.dbg.teleport(400, 300); t.adv(.1);\\n  const e = t.dbg.makeEnemy('thug', 418, 300); e.cd = 99; h.facing = 0; h.aim = 0;\\n  const hp0 = e.hp; t.tap('attack', .4); t.tap('attack', .4);\\n  check('punches land on a foe in front', e.hp < hp0, hp0 + ' -> ' + e.hp);\\n  t.dbg.setState({ up: { pistol: true } }); t.dbg.level().hero.gun = true;\\n  e.x = 480; e.y = 300; e.hp = 40; e.vx = e.vy = 0; h.facing = 0; h.aim = 0; t.adv(.05); t.tap('attack', .6);\\n  check('the pistol fires a bullet that hits', e.hp < 40, e.hp);\\n  check('a shot costs ammo', h.ammo === 7, h.ammo);\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) { h.cool = 0; t.tap('attack', .02); } check('an empty clip reloads', h.reload > 0 || h.ammo === 8, h.ammo + ' ' + h.reload);\\n  // smoke: a cloud that stuns a thug in it and hides the hero from an agent\\n  const S = t.dbg.state(); S.sel = 'smoke'; const sm0 = S.flasks.smoke;\\n  e.x = 470; e.y = 300; e.stun = 0; e.hp = 40; t.tap('throw', 1.2);\\n  check('a smoke flask leaves a cloud', W.clouds.length === 1 && S.flasks.smoke === sm0 - 1, W.clouds.length + ' ' + S.flasks.smoke);\\n  W.clouds[0].x = e.x; W.clouds[0].y = e.y; t.adv(.2);\\n  check('a foe in the smoke is stunned', e.stun > 0, e.stun);\\n  t.tap('cycle'); check('cycle switches the flask', S.sel === 'fulm', S.sel);\\n  // fulminate stuns an agent and raises heat\\n  const ag = W.agents[0]; ag.stun = 0; ag.x = 600; ag.y = 300; const heat0 = S.heat; t.dbg.burst(600, 300, 'fulm'); t.adv(.05);\\n  check('a blast stuns an agent and adds heat', ag.stun > 0 && S.heat > heat0, ag.stun + ' ' + heat0 + '->' + S.heat);\\n  check('no errors (combat)', !t.errors().length, t.errors().join('|'));\\n}\\n{ // the DEA: seen holding -> alert -> busted (loses product, 30% of dirty cash)\\n  const t = load('#ep=2.1'); t.adv(1.5);\\n  const W = t.dbg.level(), h = W.hero, S = t.dbg.state();\\n  S.product = 4; S.dirty = 1000; S.clock = 12;\\n  W.agents.length = 0; const a = t.dbg.makeAgent(0, 0, 0); W.agents.forEach(x => { x.stun = 0; });\\n  const ax = a.x, ay = a.y;\\n  // stand in front of it in the open\\n  t.dbg.teleport(ax + 40, ay); a.facing = 0; a.look = 99; t.adv(.02);\\n  let st = 'calm', k = 0; while (st !== 'alert' && k++ < 600) { t.adv(1 / 120); st = a.state; }\\n  check('an agent who sees the product goes alert', st === 'alert', st + ' after ' + k + ' steps');\\n  let n = 0; while (t.snap().scene === 'town' && n++ < 600) t.adv(1 / 60);\\n  check('caught by an alert agent: busted', t.snap().scene === 'busted', t.snap().scene);\\n  check('busted: product seized, 30% of dirty cash', S.product === 0 && S.dirty === 700, S.product + ' ' + S.dirty);\\n  t.adv(2); t.tap('confirm'); t.adv(1); check('busted -> back home', t.snap().scene === 'town', t.snap().scene);\\n  // an agent ignores a hero holding nothing at low heat\\n  const W2 = t.dbg.level(); const S2 = t.dbg.state(); S2.product = 0; S2.heat = 0; W2.agents.length = 0; const b = t.dbg.makeAgent(1, 0, 1);\\n  t.dbg.teleport(b.x + 40, b.y); b.facing = 0; b.look = 99; t.adv(2);\\n  check('clean-handed at low heat: the agent stays calm', b.state === 'calm' || b.state === 'notice', b.state);\\n  // heat decays\\n  S2.heat = 50; t.adv(6); check('heat decays over time', S2.heat < 50, S2.heat);\\n  check('no errors (DEA)', !t.errors().length, t.errors().join('|'));\\n}\\n{ // player 2, camera views, prompts, settings\\n  const t = load('#ep=2.1'); t.adv(1.5);\\n  const W = t.dbg.level();\\n  const p2 = t.game.addPlayer({ keys: 'right' }); t.adv(.2);\\n  check('a second player joins as Dusty', t.snap().p2, JSON.stringify(t.snap()));\\n  const d = W.partner, x0 = d.x; p2.hold('right'); t.adv(.6); p2.hold('right', false);\\n  check('player 2 moves Dusty', d.x - x0 > 20, x0 + ' -> ' + d.x);\\n  const v0 = t.snap().view; t.tap('view'); const v1 = t.snap().view; t.tap('view'); const v2 = t.snap().view; t.tap('view');\\n  check('the camera cycles threequarter -> topdown -> iso -> threequarter', v0 === 'threequarter' && v1 === 'topdown' && v2 === 'iso' && t.snap().view === 'threequarter', [v0, v1, v2, t.snap().view].join(' '));\\n  t.I.lastDevice = 'gamepad';\\n  check('PlayStation glyphs by default', t.I.label('interact') === '✕', t.I.label('interact'));\\n  t.game.settings.set('glyphs', 'Xbox'); check('Settings: Xbox glyphs', t.I.label('interact') === 'A', t.I.label('interact'));\\n  t.game.settings.set('glyphs', 'PlayStation');\\n  t.I.lastDevice = 'keyboard'; check('keyboard prompts name keys', t.I.label('interact') === 'E', t.I.label('interact'));\\n  check('settings has the invert toggles', t.game.settings.spec('invertX') && t.game.settings.spec('invertY'), '');\\n  check('no errors (p2/views)', !t.errors().length, t.errors().join('|'));\\n}\\n{ // the stick inversion, through a fake gamepad\\n  let axes = [0.9, 0, 0, 0];\\n  const pad = () => ({ id: 'DualSense Wireless Controller', index: 0, connected: true, mapping: 'standard', timestamp: 1, buttons: Array.from({ length: 17 }, () => ({ pressed: false, value: 0 })), axes });\\n  const nav = { getGamepads: () => [pad()], maxTouchPoints: 0 };\\n  const t = load('#town', { navigator: nav }); t.adv(1.5);\\n  const h = t.dbg.level().hero; t.dbg.teleport(C(28), C(12)); t.adv(.1);\\n  let x0 = h.x; t.adv(.5); const plain = h.x - x0;\\n  t.game.settings.set('invertX', true); x0 = h.x; t.adv(.5); const inv = h.x - x0;\\n  check('the pad pushes right; Invert stick horizontal flips it', plain > 10 && inv < -10, plain.toFixed(1) + ' / ' + inv.toFixed(1));\\n  t.game.settings.set('invertX', false); axes = [0, 0.9, 0, 0]; t.game.settings.set('invertY', true); let y0 = h.y; t.adv(.5);\\n  check('Invert stick vertical flips up and down', h.y - y0 < -10, (h.y - y0).toFixed(1));\\n  check('PS glyphs from a DualSense', t.I.label('interact') === '✕', t.I.label('interact'));\\n  function C(c) { return c * 16 + 8; }\\n}\\n{ // the attract mode: 10 s idle -> a demo; any input -> back to the title, the player's state untouched\\n  const t = load(''); t.adv(1);\\n  t.dbg.setState({ dirty: 123 });\\n  t.adv(9); check('title waits under 10 s', t.snap().scene === 'title', t.snap().scene);\\n  t.adv(2); check('after 10 s idle the demo starts', t.snap().scene === 'town' && t.snap().demo, JSON.stringify(t.snap()));\\n  t.adv(30); check('the demo plays on (cook, fight)', t.snap().scene === 'town' && !t.errors().length, t.snap().scene + ' ' + t.errors().join('|'));\\n  t.tap('attack'); t.adv(1); check('any input leaves the demo', t.snap().scene === 'title', t.snap().scene);\\n  check('the player\\\\'s state is restored after the demo', t.dbg.state().dirty === 123, t.dbg.state().dirty);\\n  const t2 = load(''); t2.adv(11); t2.adv(80); check('an untouched demo loops back to the title', t2.snap().scene === 'title' || t2.snap().demo, t2.snap().scene);\\n  check('no errors (attract)', !t2.errors().length, t2.errors().join('|'));\\n}\\n{ // touch-only devices: no touch controls, a notice and Settings only, the attract mode still runs\\n  const nav = { getGamepads: () => [], maxTouchPoints: 5 };\\n  const t = load('', { navigator: nav, matchMedia: q => ({ matches: false }) }); t.adv(1);\\n  check('touch-only is detected', t.dbg.touchOnly(), '');\\n  check('touch-only title offers Settings only', JSON.stringify(t.dbg.titleItems()) === '[\\\"SETTINGS\\\"]', JSON.stringify(t.dbg.titleItems()));\\n  check('touch controls are off', t.I.touchEnabled === false, t.I.touchEnabled);\\n  t.adv(11); check('touch-only: the attract mode runs', t.snap().demo, t.snap().scene);\\n}\\n{ // saves, continue, death and retry\\n  const t = load(''); t.adv(.5); t.tap('confirm'); t.adv(1);\\n  const S = t.dbg.state(); S.dirty = 777; t.dbg.advance(); t.adv(.2);       // a step advance autosaves\\n  t.game.go('title'); t.adv(1);\\n  check('the title offers CONTINUE after a save', t.dbg.titleItems()[0] === 'CONTINUE', JSON.stringify(t.dbg.titleItems()));\\n  t.tap('confirm'); t.adv(1);\\n  check('continue loads the save', t.snap().scene === 'town' && t.dbg.state().dirty === 777 && t.snap().step === 1, JSON.stringify(t.snap()));\\n  const h = t.dbg.level().hero; t.dbg.hurtHero(h, 999); t.adv(2);\\n  check('losing all health -> the dead screen', t.snap().scene === 'dead', t.snap().scene);\\n  t.tap('confirm'); t.adv(1); check('TRY AGAIN reloads the checkpoint', t.snap().scene === 'town' && t.snap().hp === 100, JSON.stringify(t.snap()));\\n  check('no errors (saves)', !t.errors().length, t.errors().join('|'));\\n}\\n{ // the cook: no presses -> poor purity; the shop needs clean cash; the salon's launder rate\\n  const t = load('#cook'); t.adv(1);\\n  check('the cook deep link opens the cook', t.snap().modal === 'cook', t.snap().modal);\\n  t.adv(30); const m = t.dbg.modal(); check('a cook nobody plays scores low (< 80%)', m && m.phase === 'result' && m.purity < 80, m && m.purity);\\n  t.tap('confirm', .3); t.dbg.skipTalk(); t.adv(.3);\\n  check('poor product still counts', t.dbg.state().product === 6, t.dbg.state().product);\\n  const S = t.dbg.state(); S.ep = 3; S.step = 0; S.clean = 100; S.flags.shop = true;\\n  t.dbg.teleport(t.dbg.spot.lenny.x, t.dbg.spot.lenny.y + 4); t.adv(.2); t.tap('interact', .3); t.tap('confirm', .3);\\n  check('the shop refuses without clean cash', !S.up.glass, JSON.stringify(S.up));\\n  t.adv(.3); t.tap('cancel', .3);\\n  S.dirty = 1000; S.up.salon = true; t.dbg.teleport(t.dbg.spot.carwash.x, t.dbg.spot.carwash.y); t.adv(.2); t.tap('interact', .3); t.tap('confirm', .3);\\n  check('the nail salon front launders at 95%', S.clean === 100 + 950, S.clean);\\n  check('no errors (cook/shop)', !t.errors().length, t.errors().join('|'));\\n}\\n{ // AI Hub: ghost mode, a fake hub that plays the protocol\\n  const calls = []; const handlers = {}; let now = -Infinity;\\n  const hub = { active: true, connect: o => { calls.push(['connect', o]); return Promise.resolve({ me: 0, players: [{ id: 0, name: 'Ann', color: '#e8443a' }, { id: 1, name: 'Bo', color: '#3b82f6' }], host: 0, isHost: true, mode: 'ghost', round: 1, limitMs: 300000, seed: 42 }); },\\n    ready: () => calls.push(['ready']), time: () => now, on: (e, f) => { handlers[e] = f; return () => {}; }, send: (d, o) => { calls.push(['send', d]); return true; },\\n    progress: p => calls.push(['progress', p]), result: r => calls.push(['result', r]), rng: () => { let s = 7; return () => (s = (s * 16807) % 2147483647) / 2147483647; }, fail: m => calls.push(['fail', m]) };\\n  const t = load('', { hub }); await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 20)); t.adv(1);\\n  check('hub: connects in ghost mode, seats 1-4', calls.some(c => c[0] === 'connect' && c[1].mode === 'ghost' && c[1].seats[0] === 1 && c[1].seats[1] === 4), JSON.stringify(calls.slice(0, 2)));\\n  check('hub: straight into the round (no title)', t.snap().scene === 'hubround', t.snap().scene);\\n  check('hub: ready() without a key press', calls.some(c => c[0] === 'ready'), '');\\n  const h = t.dbg.level().hero, x0 = h.x; t.hold('right', .5);\\n  check('hub: nobody moves before the start', h.x === x0, x0 + ' ' + h.x);\\n  now = 0; handlers.start && handlers.start({ in: 0 });\\n  const tick = s => { for (let i = 0; i < s * 60; i++) { now += 1000 / 60; t.adv(1 / 60); } };\\n  t.I.hold('right'); tick(1); t.I.hold('right', false);\\n  check('hub: play begins at time 0', h.x > x0 + 20, x0 + ' -> ' + h.x);\\n  check('hub: ghost position sent', calls.some(c => c[0] === 'send' && c[1].t === 'g'), '');\\n  tick(1.2); check('hub: progress reported', calls.some(c => c[0] === 'progress'), '');\\n  handlers.message && handlers.message({ t: 'g', area: 'hub', x: 300, y: 100, f: 0 }, 1); tick(.2);\\n  check('hub: another player shows as a ghost', t.dbg.level().ghosts.size === 1 && t.dbg.level().ghosts.get(1).name === 'Bo', '');\\n  handlers.leave && handlers.leave({ id: 1, reason: 'left' }); check('hub: a leaving player\\\\'s ghost goes', t.dbg.level().ghosts.size === 0, '');\\n  // sell something: score goes up\\n  const S = t.dbg.state(); S.product = 3; S.purity = 95; const b = t.dbg.level().buyers[0]; t.dbg.level().agents.forEach(a => a.stun = 99);\\n  t.dbg.teleport(b.x, b.y + 8); tick(.1); t.tap('interact', .3); t.talkThrough(); tick(.1);\\n  check('hub: a deal raises the score', S.earned > 0, S.earned);\\n  handlers['time-up'] && handlers['time-up']({ graceMs: 3000 });\\n  const res = calls.filter(c => c[0] === 'result');\\n  check('hub: time-up reports one result with the score', res.length === 1 && res[0][1].score === Math.round(S.earned), JSON.stringify(res));\\n  handlers['time-up'] && handlers['time-up']({ graceMs: 3000 }); check('hub: result only once', calls.filter(c => c[0] === 'result').length === 1, '');\\n  handlers.end && handlers.end({ reason: 'finished', standings: [[0]] }); const sends = calls.filter(c => c[0] === 'send').length; tick(1);\\n  check('hub: after end, nothing more is sent', calls.filter(c => c[0] === 'send').length === sends, '');\\n  check('no errors (hub)', !t.errors().length, t.errors().join('|'));\\n}\\ndone();\\nEOF\\nnode build.mjs >/dev/null && node test/systems.mjs\",\"description\":\"Write and run systems test suite\"},\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":2679,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":297013,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":2679,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"output_tokens\":2,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"3f3c3e9b-9eb4-44c2-94b1-164e7be1aa93\",\"uuid\":\"e9f6c157-f08a-4cea-a26c-2e84c40e21f7\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-03T01:46:16.620Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgf9b8DTHPxG62ZS3nw2Q\",\"wire_tool_inputs\":{\"toolu_01X2NWpNS4tJtDfUvcc1oAxy\":{\"command\":\"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181319__xb81546/work/BreakingBackyard-BreakingBad-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181319 && python3 - <<'EOF'\\np='src/90-start.js'; s=open(p).read()\\ns=s.replace(\\\"  touchOnly: () => touchOnly(),\\\",\\\"  touchOnly: () => touchOnly(), titleItems: () => titleItems().map(i => i.label), mixHex,\\\")\\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\\np='test/lib.mjs'; s=open(p).read()\\ns=s.replace(\\\"  if (o.hub) ctx.AIHub = o.hub;\\\",\\\"  if (o.hub) ctx.AIHub = o.hub;\\\\n  if (o.navigator) ctx.navigator = o.navigator;\\\\n  if (o.matchMedia) ctx.matchMedia = o.matchMedia;\\\")\\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\\nEOF\\ncat > test/systems.mjs <<'EOF'\\n// Every system on its own, headless.\\nimport { load, check, done } from './lib.mjs';\\nconst near = (a, b, d) => Math.abs(a - b) <= d;\\n\\n{ // movement, walls, sprint, dodge\\n  const t = load('#town'); t.adv(1.5);\\n  const W = t.dbg.level(), h = W.hero;\\n  const x0 = h.x; t.hold('right', .5); check('walking right moves the hero', h.x - x0 > 25, x0 + ' -> ' + h.x);\\n  t.dbg.teleport(t.dbg.spot.home.x, t.dbg.spot.home.y); t.adv(.1); const y0 = h.y; t.hold('up', 1.5);\\n  check('the house wall stops the hero', h.y > 112 - 8 && h.y <= y0, y0 + ' -> ' + h.y);\\n  t.dbg.teleport(C(28), C(12)); t.adv(.1); let a = h.x; t.hold('right', .5); const walk = h.x - a;\\n  a = h.x; t.I.hold('sprint'); t.hold('right', .5); t.I.hold('sprint', false); const run = h.x - a;\\n  check('sprint is faster than walking', run > walk * 1.3, walk.toFixed(1) + ' vs ' + run.toFixed(1));\\n  t.tap('dodge', .02); check('a dodge roll gives invulnerability frames', h.iT > 0 && h.dodgeT > 0, h.iT + ' ' + h.dodgeT);\\n  check('no errors (movement)', !t.errors().length, t.errors().join('|'));\\n  function C(c) { return c * 16 + 8; }\\n}\\n{ // punches, the pistol, flasks, smoke\\n  const t = load('#ep=2.1'); t.adv(1.5);\\n  const W = t.dbg.level(), h = W.hero; W.agents.forEach(a => a.stun = 99);\\n  t.dbg.teleport(400, 300); t.adv(.1);\\n  const e = t.dbg.makeEnemy('thug', 418, 300); e.cd = 99; h.facing = 0; h.aim = 0;\\n  const hp0 = e.hp; t.tap('attack', .4); t.tap('attack', .4);\\n  check('punches land on a foe in front', e.hp < hp0, hp0 + ' -> ' + e.hp);\\n  t.dbg.setState({ up: { pistol: true } }); t.dbg.level().hero.gun = true;\\n  e.x = 480; e.y = 300; e.hp = 40; e.vx = e.vy = 0; h.facing = 0; h.aim = 0; t.adv(.05); t.tap('attack', .6);\\n  check('the pistol fires a bullet that hits', e.hp < 40, e.hp);\\n  check('a shot costs ammo', h.ammo === 7, h.ammo);\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) { h.cool = 0; t.tap('attack', .02); } check('an empty clip reloads', h.reload > 0 || h.ammo === 8, h.ammo + ' ' + h.reload);\\n  // smoke: a cloud that stuns a thug in it and hides the hero from an agent\\n  const S = t.dbg.state(); S.sel = 'smoke'; const sm0 = S.flasks.smoke;\\n  e.x = 470; e.y = 300; e.stun = 0; e.hp = 40; t.tap('throw', 1.2);\\n  check('a smoke flask leaves a cloud', W.clouds.length === 1 && S.flasks.smoke === sm0 - 1, W.clouds.length + ' ' + S.flasks.smoke);\\n  W.clouds[0].x = e.x; W.clouds[0].y = e.y; t.adv(.2);\\n  check('a foe in the smoke is stunned', e.stun > 0, e.stun);\\n  t.tap('cycle'); check('cycle switches the flask', S.sel === 'fulm', S.sel);\\n  // fulminate stuns an agent and raises heat\\n  const ag = W.agents[0]; ag.stun = 0; ag.x = 600; ag.y = 300; const heat0 = S.heat; t.dbg.burst(600, 300, 'fulm'); t.adv(.05);\\n  check('a blast stuns an agent and adds heat', ag.stun > 0 && S.heat > heat0, ag.stun + ' ' + heat0 + '->' + S.heat);\\n  check('no errors (combat)', !t.errors().length, t.errors().join('|'));\\n}\\n{ // the DEA: seen holding -> alert -> busted (loses product, 30% of dirty cash)\\n  const t = load('#ep=2.1'); t.adv(1.5);\\n  const W = t.dbg.level(), h = W.hero, S = t.dbg.state();\\n  S.product = 4; S.dirty = 1000; S.clock = 12;\\n  W.agents.length = 0; const a = t.dbg.makeAgent(0, 0, 0); W.agents.forEach(x => { x.stun = 0; });\\n  const ax = a.x, ay = a.y;\\n  // stand in front of it in the open\\n  t.dbg.teleport(ax + 40, ay); a.facing = 0; a.look = 99; t.adv(.02);\\n  let st = 'calm', k = 0; while (st !== 'alert' && k++ < 600) { t.adv(1 / 120); st = a.state; }\\n  check('an agent who sees the product goes alert', st === 'alert', st + ' after ' + k + ' steps');\\n  let n = 0; while (t.snap().scene === 'town' && n++ < 600) t.adv(1 / 60);\\n  check('caught by an alert agent: busted', t.snap().scene === 'busted', t.snap().scene);\\n  check('busted: product seized, 30% of dirty cash', S.product === 0 && S.dirty === 700, S.product + ' ' + S.dirty);\\n  t.adv(2); t.tap('confirm'); t.adv(1); check('busted -> back home', t.snap().scene === 'town', t.snap().scene);\\n  // an agent ignores a hero holding nothing at low heat\\n  const W2 = t.dbg.level(); const S2 = t.dbg.state(); S2.product = 0; S2.heat = 0; W2.agents.length = 0; const b = t.dbg.makeAgent(1, 0, 1);\\n  t.dbg.teleport(b.x + 40, b.y); b.facing = 0; b.look = 99; t.adv(2);\\n  check('clean-handed at low heat: the agent stays calm', b.state === 'calm' || b.state === 'notice', b.state);\\n  // heat decays\\n  S2.heat = 50; t.adv(6); check('heat decays over time', S2.heat < 50, S2.heat);\\n  check('no errors (DEA)', !t.errors().length, t.errors().join('|'));\\n}\\n{ // player 2, camera views, prompts, settings\\n  const t = load('#ep=2.1'); t.adv(1.5);\\n  const W = t.dbg.level();\\n  const p2 = t.game.addPlayer({ keys: 'right' }); t.adv(.2);\\n  check('a second player joins as Dusty', t.snap().p2, JSON.stringify(t.snap()));\\n  const d = W.partner, x0 = d.x; p2.hold('right'); t.adv(.6); p2.hold('right', false);\\n  check('player 2 moves Dusty', d.x - x0 > 20, x0 + ' -> ' + d.x);\\n  const v0 = t.snap().view; t.tap('view'); const v1 = t.snap().view; t.tap('view'); const v2 = t.snap().view; t.tap('view');\\n  check('the camera cycles threequarter -> topdown -> iso -> threequarter', v0 === 'threequarter' && v1 === 'topdown' && v2 === 'iso' && t.snap().view === 'threequarter', [v0, v1, v2, t.snap().view].join(' '));\\n  t.I.lastDevice = 'gamepad';\\n  check('PlayStation glyphs by default', t.I.label('interact') === '✕', t.I.label('interact'));\\n  t.game.settings.set('glyphs', 'Xbox'); check('Settings: Xbox glyphs', t.I.label('interact') === 'A', t.I.label('interact'));\\n  t.game.settings.set('glyphs', 'PlayStation');\\n  t.I.lastDevice = 'keyboard'; check('keyboard prompts name keys', t.I.label('interact') === 'E', t.I.label('interact'));\\n  check('settings has the invert toggles', t.game.settings.spec('invertX') && t.game.settings.spec('invertY'), '');\\n  check('no errors (p2/views)', !t.errors().length, t.errors().join('|'));\\n}\\n{ // the stick inversion, through a fake gamepad\\n  let axes = [0.9, 0, 0, 0];\\n  const pad = () => ({ id: 'DualSense Wireless Controller', index: 0, connected: true, mapping: 'standard', timestamp: 1, buttons: Array.from({ length: 17 }, () => ({ pressed: false, value: 0 })), axes });\\n  const nav = { getGamepads: () => [pad()], maxTouchPoints: 0 };\\n  const t = load('#town', { navigator: nav }); t.adv(1.5);\\n  const h = t.dbg.level().hero; t.dbg.teleport(C(28), C(12)); t.adv(.1);\\n  let x0 = h.x; t.adv(.5); const plain = h.x - x0;\\n  t.game.settings.set('invertX', true); x0 = h.x; t.adv(.5); const inv = h.x - x0;\\n  check('the pad pushes right; Invert stick horizontal flips it', plain > 10 && inv < -10, plain.toFixed(1) + ' / ' + inv.toFixed(1));\\n  t.game.settings.set('invertX', false); axes = [0, 0.9, 0, 0]; t.game.settings.set('invertY', true); let y0 = h.y; t.adv(.5);\\n  check('Invert stick vertical flips up and down', h.y - y0 < -10, (h.y - y0).toFixed(1));\\n  check('PS glyphs from a DualSense', t.I.label('interact') === '✕', t.I.label('interact'));\\n  function C(c) { return c * 16 + 8; }\\n}\\n{ // the attract mode: 10 s idle -> a demo; any input -> back to the title, the player's state untouched\\n  const t = load(''); t.adv(1);\\n  t.dbg.setState({ dirty: 123 });\\n  t.adv(9); check('title waits under 10 s', t.snap().scene === 'title', t.snap().scene);\\n  t.adv(2); check('after 10 s idle the demo starts', t.snap().scene === 'town' && t.snap().demo, JSON.stringify(t.snap()));\\n  t.adv(30); check('the demo plays on (cook, fight)', t.snap().scene === 'town' && !t.errors().length, t.snap().scene + ' ' + t.errors().join('|'));\\n  t.tap('attack'); t.adv(1); check('any input leaves the demo', t.snap().scene === 'title', t.snap().scene);\\n  check('the player\\\\'s state is restored after the demo', t.dbg.state().dirty === 123, t.dbg.state().dirty);\\n  const t2 = load(''); t2.adv(11); t2.adv(80); check('an untouched demo loops back to the title', t2.snap().scene === 'title' || t2.snap().demo, t2.snap().scene);\\n  check('no errors (attract)', !t2.errors().length, t2.errors().join('|'));\\n}\\n{ // touch-only devices: no touch controls, a notice and Settings only, the attract mode still runs\\n  const nav = { getGamepads: () => [], maxTouchPoints: 5 };\\n  const t = load('', { navigator: nav, matchMedia: q => ({ matches: false }) }); t.adv(1);\\n  check('touch-only is detected', t.dbg.touchOnly(), '');\\n  check('touch-only title offers Settings only', JSON.stringify(t.dbg.titleItems()) === '[\\\"SETTINGS\\\"]', JSON.stringify(t.dbg.titleItems()));\\n  check('touch controls are off', t.I.touchEnabled === false, t.I.touchEnabled);\\n  t.adv(11); check('touch-only: the attract mode runs', t.snap().demo, t.snap().scene);\\n}\\n{ // saves, continue, death and retry\\n  const t = load(''); t.adv(.5); t.tap('confirm'); t.adv(1);\\n  const S = t.dbg.state(); S.dirty = 777; t.dbg.advance(); t.adv(.2);       // a step advance autosaves\\n  t.game.go('title'); t.adv(1);\\n  check('the title offers CONTINUE after a save', t.dbg.titleItems()[0] === 'CONTINUE', JSON.stringify(t.dbg.titleItems()));\\n  t.tap('confirm'); t.adv(1);\\n  check('continue loads the save', t.snap().scene === 'town' && t.dbg.state().dirty === 777 && t.snap().step === 1, JSON.stringify(t.snap()));\\n  const h = t.dbg.level().hero; t.dbg.hurtHero(h, 999); t.adv(2);\\n  check('losing all health -> the dead screen', t.snap().scene === 'dead', t.snap().scene);\\n  t.tap('confirm'); t.adv(1); check('TRY AGAIN reloads the checkpoint', t.snap().scene === 'town' && t.snap().hp === 100, JSON.stringify(t.snap()));\\n  check('no errors (saves)', !t.errors().length, t.errors().join('|'));\\n}\\n{ // the cook: no presses -> poor purity; the shop needs clean cash; the salon's launder rate\\n  const t = load('#cook'); t.adv(1);\\n  check('the cook deep link opens the cook', t.snap().modal === 'cook', t.snap().modal);\\n  t.adv(30); const m = t.dbg.modal(); check('a cook nobody plays scores low (< 80%)', m && m.phase === 'result' && m.purity < 80, m && m.purity);\\n  t.tap('confirm', .3); t.dbg.skipTalk(); t.adv(.3);\\n  check('poor product still counts', t.dbg.state().product === 6, t.dbg.state().product);\\n  const S = t.dbg.state(); S.ep = 3; S.step = 0; S.clean = 100; S.flags.shop = true;\\n  t.dbg.teleport(t.dbg.spot.lenny.x, t.dbg.spot.lenny.y + 4); t.adv(.2); t.tap('interact', .3); t.tap('confirm', .3);\\n  check('the shop refuses without clean cash', !S.up.glass, JSON.stringify(S.up));\\n  t.adv(.3); t.tap('cancel', .3);\\n  S.dirty = 1000; S.up.salon = true; t.dbg.teleport(t.dbg.spot.carwash.x, t.dbg.spot.carwash.y); t.adv(.2); t.tap('interact', .3); t.tap('confirm', .3);\\n  check('the nail salon front launders at 95%', S.clean === 100 + 950, S.clean);\\n  check('no errors (cook/shop)', !t.errors().length, t.errors().join('|'));\\n}\\n{ // AI Hub: ghost mode, a fake hub that plays the protocol\\n  const calls = []; const handlers = {}; let now = -Infinity;\\n  const hub = { active: true, connect: o => { calls.push(['connect', o]); return Promise.resolve({ me: 0, players: [{ id: 0, name: 'Ann', color: '#e8443a' }, { id: 1, name: 'Bo', color: '#3b82f6' }], host: 0, isHost: true, mode: 'ghost', round: 1, limitMs: 300000, seed: 42 }); },\\n    ready: () => calls.push(['ready']), time: () => now, on: (e, f) => { handlers[e] = f; return () => {}; }, send: (d, o) => { calls.push(['send', d]); return true; },\\n    progress: p => calls.push(['progress', p]), result: r => calls.push(['result', r]), rng: () => { let s = 7; return () => (s = (s * 16807) % 2147483647) / 2147483647; }, fail: m => calls.push(['fail', m]) };\\n  const t = load('', { hub }); await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 20)); t.adv(1);\\n  check('hub: connects in ghost mode, seats 1-4', calls.some(c => c[0] === 'connect' && c[1].mode === 'ghost' && c[1].seats[0] === 1 && c[1].seats[1] === 4), JSON.stringify(calls.slice(0, 2)));\\n  check('hub: straight into the round (no title)', t.snap().scene === 'hubround', t.snap().scene);\\n  check('hub: ready() without a key press', calls.some(c => c[0] === 'ready'), '');\\n  const h = t.dbg.level().hero, x0 = h.x; t.hold('right', .5);\\n  check('hub: nobody moves before the start', h.x === x0, x0 + ' ' + h.x);\\n  now = 0; handlers.start && handlers.start({ in: 0 });\\n  const tick = s => { for (let i = 0; i < s * 60; i++) { now += 1000 / 60; t.adv(1 / 60); } };\\n  t.I.hold('right'); tick(1); t.I.hold('right', false);\\n  check('hub: play begins at time 0', h.x > x0 + 20, x0 + ' -> ' + h.x);\\n  check('hub: ghost position sent', calls.some(c => c[0] === 'send' && c[1].t === 'g'), '');\\n  tick(1.2); check('hub: progress reported', calls.some(c => c[0] === 'progress'), '');\\n  handlers.message && handlers.message({ t: 'g', area: 'hub', x: 300, y: 100, f: 0 }, 1); tick(.2);\\n  check('hub: another player shows as a ghost', t.dbg.level().ghosts.size === 1 && t.dbg.level().ghosts.get(1).name === 'Bo', '');\\n  handlers.leave && handlers.leave({ id: 1, reason: 'left' }); check('hub: a leaving player\\\\'s ghost goes', t.dbg.level().ghosts.size === 0, '');\\n  // sell something: score goes up\\n  const S = t.dbg.state(); S.product = 3; S.purity = 95; const b = t.dbg.level().buyers[0]; t.dbg.level().agents.forEach(a => a.stun = 99);\\n  t.dbg.teleport(b.x, b.y + 8); tick(.1); t.tap('interact', .3); t.talkThrough(); tick(.1);\\n  check('hub: a deal raises the score', S.earned > 0, S.earned);\\n  handlers['time-up'] && handlers['time-up']({ graceMs: 3000 });\\n  const res = calls.filter(c => c[0] === 'result');\\n  check('hub: time-up reports one result with the score', res.length === 1 && res[0][1].score === Math.round(S.earned), JSON.stringify(res));\\n  handlers['time-up'] && handlers['time-up']({ graceMs: 3000 }); check('hub: result only once', calls.filter(c => c[0] === 'result').length === 1, '');\\n  handlers.end && handlers.end({ reason: 'finished', standings: [[0]] }); const sends = calls.filter(c => c[0] === 'send').length; tick(1);\\n  check('hub: after end, nothing more is sent', calls.filter(c => c[0] === 'send').length === sends, '');\\n  check('no errors (hub)', !t.errors().length, t.errors().join('|'));\\n}\\ndone();\\nEOF\\nnode build.mjs >/dev/null && node test/systems.mjs\",\"description\":\"Write and run systems test suite\"}},\"wire_ingest_context\":{\"toolu_01X2NWpNS4tJtDfUvcc1oAxy\":{\"cwd\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181319__xb81546/work/BreakingBackyard-BreakingBad-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181319\"}}}"]}]}],"moreFiles":24,"changedFiles":["/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181307__x22cc1b/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181307__x22cc1b/work/Rewired-TheWire-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181307/test/systems.mjs","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181310__xac1bf5/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20